1
00:00:00,530 --> 00:00:02,490
(Leonard:)Great. You do that.

2
00:00:02,657 --> 00:00:05,657
(Sheldon:)Would you like me to bring you
some warm milk?

3
00:00:05,827 --> 00:00:07,497
(Leonard:)I'm lactose intolerant.

4
00:00:07,662 --> 00:00:12,502
(Sheldon:)And you don't wish to alarm me with
any more loud noises. Very thoughtful.

5
00:00:12,667 --> 00:00:15,377
(Sheldon:)-Warm milk, Penny?
-No, thanks.

6
00:00:15,878 --> 00:00:20,218
(Sheldon:)Fine. Good night to you, sir. Miss.

7
00:00:23,219 --> 00:00:26,719
(Leonard:)-Sorry about that.
-What can you do?

8
00:00:27,640 --> 00:00:28,770
[ALARM WAILING]

9
00:00:28,933 --> 00:00:31,183
VOICE: Intruder alert. Intruder alert.
Intruder alert.

10
00:00:31,352 --> 00:00:32,482
[SHELDON SCREAMING]

11
00:00:32,645 --> 00:00:34,475
[ELECTRICITY CRACKLING]

12
00:00:44,031 --> 00:00:46,371
(Leonard:)Looks like Wolowitz
got the net electrified.

13
00:00:47,368 --> 00:00:50,498
(Penny:)-Sheldon, are you okay?
-I'm fine.

14
00:00:51,372 --> 00:00:59,022
(Sheldon:)Though I'm no longer
the master of my own bladder.

